    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d31">

                <pb facs="0052" n="40" xml:id="pg40"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">860F.00/631: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Czechoslovakia</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Carr</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Praha</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1939-03-15T06:00:00+01:00">March 15, 1939—6
                            a.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 6:20 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>32. The occupation of the remainder of this country by German troops is scheduled
                    to begin at this moment, i. e., 6 a.m.</p>
                <p>The Military Attaché reports that this information has been confirmed by the
                    General Staff.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Carr</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
